---
title: Home
layout: base
---

<section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.role }}</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Hi, I'm Wade.</h1>
        <p class="lead">I lead the team building <a href="https://inventorybase.com/">Inventory Base</a> and <a href="https://propertyinspect.com">Property Inspect</a>. I've been on that team for more than eight years: first as an engineer, now as its manager.</p>
        <p class="lead">I write about how we build software and how we run the team. Outside work, you'll find me running, cycling, cooking, or doing DIY with my family.</p>
        <div class="button-row">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="/blog/">Read my writing</a>
            <a class="button" href="{{ site.linkedin }}">Say hello on LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image">
        <img eleventy:ignore src="/assets/img/wade-hello.svg" alt="Illustration of Wade waving" width="585" height="827">
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container section" aria-labelledby="pillars">
    <h2 id="pillars" class="eyebrow">What I write about</h2>
    <div class="pillar-grid">
        {%- for pillar in pillars %}
            <a class="pillar-card" href="/tags/{{ pillar.slug }}/">
                <span class="pillar-card-name">{{ pillar.name }}</span>
                <span class="pillar-card-text">{{ pillar.description }}</span>
            </a>
        {%- endfor %}
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container section" aria-labelledby="recent">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 id="recent" class="eyebrow">Recent writing</h2>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/blog/">All writing →</a>
    </div>
    {% set items = collections.writing.slice(0, 5) %}
    {% include "post-list.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="container section" aria-labelledby="numbers">
    <div class="stats-strip">
        <img eleventy:ignore class="stats-strip-image" src="/assets/img/wade-jogging.svg" alt="" width="72" height="102">
        <div class="stats-strip-body">
            <h2 id="numbers" class="eyebrow">Lately, by the numbers</h2>
            <dl class="stat-grid">
                <div><dt>GitHub contributions</dt><dd>{% numberFormat github.contributions %}</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Stack Overflow reputation</dt><dd>{% numberFormat stackoverflow.reputation %}</dd></div>
                <div><dt>km on foot this month</dt><dd>{% numberFormat health.footDistance %}</dd></div>
                <div><dt>Keys pressed</dt><dd>{{ whatpulse.keys | compactNumber }}</dd></div>
            </dl>
        </div>
        <a class="arrow-link" href="/now/">More on my Now page →</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container section" aria-labelledby="hello">
    <div class="say-hello">
        <div>
            <h2 id="hello" class="say-hello-title">Thinking about working with us?</h2>
            <p class="say-hello-text">I'm always happy to chat about what it's like on the team. {% if site.email %}Message me on LinkedIn or send me an email.{% else %}Send me a message on LinkedIn.{% endif %}</p>
        </div>
        {% include "say-hello-links.njk" %}
    </div>
</section>
